llama-kld-swap (load once, swap/retype tensors, score against KLD bases) and llama-perplexity-fast.
Needs two internal hooks: llama_internal_set_weight_allocator (per-expert CUDA buffers so a retype
only pays the size difference) and node_src_type in the CUDA graph cache (a tensor retyped in place
keeps data/ne/nb, so the graph must be re-captured on a type change).

